<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan Treasury auction raises 236.5 mln dirhams.</title>
<headline>Moroccan Treasury auction raises 236.5 mln dirhams.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moroccan Treasury raised 236.5 million dirhams from its weekly treasury bill auction, Bank al-Maghrib (central bank) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Rates and amounts (in million dirhams) were accepted as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY	 BID	   AMOUNT	   INTEREST RATE</p>
<p>    13 weeks	  36.50	 36.50		    7.5</p>
<p>    52 weeks	  70	    70			 8.5</p>
<p>    Two years	120	   120			 8.8</p>
<p>    Five years	10	    10			 9.5</p>
<p>    10-years	 115	    --			 --</p>
<p>    15-years	 105	    --			 --</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Total	   456.50	  236.50</p>
<p>Maturity date was set for March 25, 1997.</p>
<p>($1= 9.4 dirhams)</p>
<p>- Rabat newsroom +212-7 726518</p>
